        "answer": {
          "short": "$2^{3}\\times53$. Correct answer: D.",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}424&=2\\times212\\\\424&=2\\times2\\times106\\\\424&=2\\times2\\times2\\times53\\\\424&=2^{3}\\times53\\end{align*}$\n\nAll factors are prime. Correct answer: D.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 0
